The Hyperdrive factory deployment process involves several contracts: Factory ! DeployerCoordinator ! InstanceCoreDeployer. The initial contribution token transfer is done in the DeployerCoordinator.initialize() function. Users have to set approvals for this contract. The token transfer is performed in the instance-overridden _prepareInitialize function with the _lp parameter of the public initialize function as the token owner.
